[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3674021031","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114161#issuecomment-3674021031","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114161","id":3674021031,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7a_Ryn","user":{"login":"FyiurAmron","id":11016998,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDE2OTk4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11016998?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FyiurAmron","html_url":"https://github.com/FyiurAmron","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FyiurAmron/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FyiurAmron/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FyiurAmron/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FyiurAmron/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FyiurAmron/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FyiurAmron/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FyiurAmron/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FyiurAmron/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FyiurAmron/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-19T08:09:33Z","updated_at":"2025-12-19T08:37:23Z","body":"@KoBeWi my 5c here:\r\n\r\n1. there is one valid case I can think of where changing the extension is indeed valid and kind-of expected, and that is going from/to `tres` to/from a corresponding binary format extension (`res` and the like). Currently it's allowed and works, doing the conversion under the hood, and I think that use case should stay possible, both for backwards compatibility and practical reasons (i.e. it's actually a simple and relatively straightforward way to convert the file text<->binary on-the-fly - whether that's actually \"duplicating\" is debatable, but I'd say it is, the _data_ is being duplicated, it's just the format that's changed - note it can be also done via {Save Icon}->Save As... resource action as well, so theoretically dropping this way of doing it is not a huge problem).\r\n2. I though about what @sockeye-d wrote (i.e. that whether this should be allowed at all or not via UI), but TBH after https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113790, changing file extension on non-imported resources fails anyway (but no longer silently) if the extension is outside of the valid range (i.e. not `tres`, `res` or explicitly named one like `.material` etc.), so the only case where this MR would cause actual behavioural change apart from 1. above is when doing dupe-with-extension-change on imported resources, which would not work properly anyway due to the file not being accessible in UI. \r\n3. as an option in case of debate, it's also possible to e.g. allow this but provide a the message in yellow (warning) about extension being changed and file potentially inaccessible via editor? This would be both compatible with the existing behaviour and would not surprise the user with inaccessible files.\r\n\r\nTo make it clear, I'm OK with prohibiting it at all via UI (similarly as deleting non-empty directories via UI is prohibited etc.), I just don't want this fix to be rejected due to being a breaking change due to any of the above reasons, and obviously I think the case 1. should probably stay the way it is (and this MR would block that functionality).","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3674021031/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3675069226","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114161#issuecomment-3675069226","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114161","id":3675069226,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7bDRsq","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-19T13:21:19Z","updated_at":"2025-12-19T13:21:19Z","body":"The reason why you can duplicate Godot resources into different extension is that ResourceSaver is involved in the duplication (it just re-saves the Resource). Which is also why it can fail.\r\n\r\nIt's easy to differentiate imported and non-imported Resources, so I made an improvement:\r\n<img width=\"482\" height=\"269\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/09d67ef5-338b-43dc-a35f-a0ca3ef96de5\" />\r\n<img width=\"482\" height=\"269\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dbed149b-b983-4bcb-aeb2-cb82eee2e7a2\" />\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3675069226/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3675261816","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114161#issuecomment-3675261816","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114161","id":3675261816,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7bEAt4","user":{"login":"FyiurAmron","id":11016998,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDE2OTk4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11016998?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FyiurAmron","html_url":"https://github.com/FyiurAmron","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FyiurAmron/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FyiurAmron/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FyiurAmron/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FyiurAmron/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FyiurAmron/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FyiurAmron/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FyiurAmron/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FyiurAmron/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FyiurAmron/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-19T14:23:16Z","updated_at":"2025-12-19T14:23:55Z","body":"@KoBeWi tested it, everything works 100% as described and expected: for imported res red message if new_ext != old_ext and OK inactive, for non-imported yellow warning on new_ext != old_ext and then,  if resource can't be converted to the new extension in ResourceSaver, error pops up. 🧈, 💯, LGTM :)","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3675261816/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3690379457","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114161#issuecomment-3690379457","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengi